helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073D				0	el	BeanShell				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_id6797082				0	el	Python				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\scripting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1091F				0	el	In addition, developers can use high-level languages, for example Java programming language, to control %PRODUCTNAME externally. See the API project at Apache OpenOffice.				20200411 15:09:53
