helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147304	4			0	el	Specifies the settings for the basic Asian fonts if Asian language support has been activated under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages.\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
