helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05020100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153663	58			0	el	To enable support for complex text layout and Asian character sets, choose \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Language Settings - Languages\</emph\>, and then select the \<emph\>Enabled \</emph\>box in the corresponding area.				20200411 15:09:53
