helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02010000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10630				0	el	To change the number of commands that you can undo, choose \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - Memory, and enter a new value in the number of steps box.				20200411 15:09:53
