helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3174230				0	el	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mark to enable the automatic check for updates. Choose %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update in the Options dialog box to disable or enable this feature.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
