helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3149603				0	el	To print two pages side by side on the same sheet, select "2" in the \<emph\>Pages per sheet\</emph\> box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\print_small.xhp	0	help	par_id3153388	22			0	el	To print multiple pages on the same sheet, select the number of pages per sheet and optionally set the order of pages. The small preview shows the arrangement of pages. 				20200411 15:09:53
