helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\auto_off.xhp	0	help	par_idN1081B				0	el	To quickly undo an automatic correction or completion, press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Z. 				20200411 15:09:53
