helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\text_centervert.xhp	0	help	par_id3156114				0	el	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Position\</item\> area, select "Center" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Horizontal\</item\> and \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Vertical\</item\> boxes.				20200411 15:09:53
