helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\field_convert.xhp	0	help	par_id3154262				0	el	Click "Unformatted text" in the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Selection\</item\> list, and then click \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>OK\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
