helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\join_numbered_lists.xhp	0	help	par_id3155911				0	el	On the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Formatting\</item\> Bar, click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Numbering On/Off\</item\> icon twice.				20200411 15:09:53
