helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074A				0	el	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the Caption dialog. It has the same information as the dialog you get by menu %PRODUCTNAME Writer - AutoCaption in the Options dialog box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
